"Order Regarding Remote Appearance | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/RA-020)\nciteturn1661search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # Order Regarding Remote Appearance (RA-020)States the court’s decision on whether a party or witness has to appear at a court proceeding in person or may appear remotely, and any limitations on the remote appearance.\n\n# Order Regarding Remote Appearance (RA-020)\n\nStates the court’s decision on whether a party or witness has to appear at a court proceeding in person or may appear remotely, and any limitations on the remote appearance.\n\nGet form RA-020\n\n  * 汉语Get form RA-020 in Chinese Simplified (Chinese Simplified)\n  * 한국어Get form RA-020 in Korean (Korean)\n  * españolGet form RA-020 in Spanish (Spanish)\n  * Tiếng ViệtGet form RA-020 in Vietnamese (Vietnamese)\n\nEffective: January 1, 2022\n\n  * Go to Remote court hearings--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRA-020 ORDER REGARDING REMOTE APPEARANCE (https://www.imperial.courts.ca.gov/system/files/forms-and-filings/ra020.pdf)\nciteturn1661search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.8 years ago; Crawled: 4.8 years ago; RA-020 ... FOR COURT USE ONLY\nRA-020\n\nATTORNEY OR PARTY WITHOUT ATTORNEY:  \nNAME:  \nFIRM NAME:  \nSTREET ADDRESS:  \nCITY:  \nSTATE:  \nZIP CODE:  \nTELEPHONE NO.:  \nFAX NO.:  \nEMAIL ADDRESS:  \nATTORNEY FOR (name):  \nSTATE BAR NUMBER:  \n\nFOR COURT USE ONLY\n\nSUPERIOR COURT OF CALIFORNIA, COUNTY OF  \nSTREET ADDRESS:  \nMAILING ADDRESS:  \nCITY AND ZIP CODE:  \nBRANCH NAME:  \n\nPLAINTIFF:  \nDEFENDANT:  \nOTHER CASE NAME:  \n\nCASE NUMBER:\n\nORDER REGARDING REMOTE APPEARANCE\n\nThe court makes the following orders regarding remote appearances:\n\n1. This order applies to the proceeding described below, including on any later dates if the proceeding is continued:  \n   Type of proceeding:  \n   Set on (date): ________ at (time): ________ in (department): ________\n\n2. ☐ Participant to appear in person.  \n   The following persons are required to appear or testify in person:  \n   Name — Role in Case\n\n3. ☐ Participant may appear through remote technology.  \n   a. The following persons may appear or testify through remote technology, subject to any requirement in b:  \n      Name — Role in Case  \n   b. If the following technology is not used, an in-person appearance is required. (See the court's website for specific information about the platforms used and how to appear remotely.)  \n      i. ☐ videoconference only  \n      ii. ☐ audio only (including telephone)  \n      iii. ☐ videoconference or audio\n\n4. ☐ Other Orders.\n\nDate: ____________________  \nJUDGE OR JUDICIAL OFFICER\n\nPage 1 of 1\n\nForm Approved for Optional Use  \nJudicial Council of California  \nRA-020 [New January 1, 2022]\n\nORDER REGARDING REMOTE APPEARANCE\n\nCode of Civil Procedure, § 367.75;  \nCal. Rules of Court, rule 3.672--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRA-020 V (https://courts.ca.gov/sites/default/files/courts/default/2024-11/ra020v.pdf)\nciteturn1661search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.6 years ago; Crawled: 3.5 years ago; RA-020 V ... Rules of Court, rule 3.672www.courts.ca.gov\nRA-020 V\n\nLUẬT SƯ HOẶC BÊN KHÔNG CÓ LUẬT SƯ:  \nTÊN:  \nTÊN CÔNG TY:  \nĐỊA CHỈ ĐƯỜNG PHỐ:  \nTHÀNH PHỐ:  \nSỐ ĐIỆN THOẠI:  \nĐỊA CHỈ EMAIL:  \nLUẬT SƯ ĐẠI DIỆN CHO (tên):  \n\nSỐ LUẬT SƯ ĐOÀN TIỂU BANG:  \nTIỂU BANG:  \nMÃ VÙNG:  \nSỐ FAX:  \n\nTÒA THƯỢNG THẨM CALIFORNIA, QUẬN  \nĐỊA CHỈ ĐƯỜNG PHỐ:  \nĐỊA CHỈ GỬI THƯ:  \nTHÀNH PHỐ VÀ MÃ VÙNG:  \nTÊN CHI NHÁNH:  \n\nNGUYÊN ĐƠN:  \nBỊ CÁO:  \nTÊN VỤ VIỆC KHÁC:  \n\nDÀNH RIÊNG CHO TÒA\n\nChỉ nhằm mục đích thông tin  \nKhông nộp lên tòa\n\nLỆNH VỀ VIỆC THAM GIA TỪ XA\n\nSỐ VỤ:  \nKhông nộp lên tòa\n\nTòa án đưa ra các lệnh sau về việc tham gia từ xa:\n\n1. Lệnh này được áp dụng cho thủ tục được mô tả dưới đây, kể cả vào bất kỳ ngày nào sau đó nếu thủ tục còn tiếp tục